OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStrong winds, and gales for
OL,6,Fexposed coasts, though these will ease
OL,7,Flater for a breezy evening. Sunny
OL,8,Fspells throughout the day but feeling
OL,9,Fcold in the wind. Scattered showers
OL,10,Fduring the morning, becoming dry in
OL,11,Fthe afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry this evening with clear
OL,14,Fspells and a gentle breeze. Cloud will
OL,15,Fthicken ahead of a band of rain
OL,16,Fbringing increasingly wet and windy
OL,17,Fweather across the southwest by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
